# The ruling of Opalescence and Humility (2006-02-01): "If the timestamp order is Opalescence, Humility, Opalescence, the
# second Opalescence is 1/1, and the Humility and first Opalescence are 4/4." Each Opalescence animates the other two
# (layer 4), and Humility takes every creature's abilities in layer 6 - the Opalescences' among them. Their effects began
# in layer 4, so their 7b parts go on applying to what they made creatures (CR 613.6). Layer 7b in timestamp order: the
# first Opalescence makes Humility and the second 4/4; Humility makes all three 1/1; the second Opalescence makes the
# first and Humility 4/4. On turn 3, before the second, Humility is 1/1 (Opalescence, then Humility).

